<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Tea 6-mth net up 72 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Tea 6-mth net up 72 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Sri Lanka's Tea Smallholder Factories Limited for the six months to September 30, 1996. (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>		     6 months 1996	    6 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	    361.88	vs	   202.58</p>
<p>    Net profit	   33.89	vs	    19.71</p>
<p>    Tax		    27.82	vs		  0</p>
<p>NOTE - Tea Smallholder Factories Limited processes tea bought from small cultivators.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom tel 941-434319</p>
</text>
